# Legacy GitHub Pages URLs → root-relative paths (301 permanent)
# (on the off chance someone saved old links from vugoda-web-2.github.io)
/vugoda-web-2/*  /:splat  301

# Force HTTPS (CF Pages already handles this by default, but fallback does not hurt)
http://vyhoda.lviv.ua/*  https://vyhoda.lviv.ua/:splat  301!
http://www.vyhoda.lviv.ua/*  https://vyhoda.lviv.ua/:splat  301!

# www → non-www (canonical: vyhoda.lviv.ua, no www)
https://www.vyhoda.lviv.ua/*  https://vyhoda.lviv.ua/:splat  301!

# NOTE: SPA 404 fallback is handled by functions/[[catchall]].ts (CF Pages Function).
# That function intercepts unknown routes and returns HTTP 404 with /404/index.html content.
# The _redirects /* rule was removed because CF Pages ignored it in favour of /index.html.
